      "raw": "<p>I just received my physical copy of OblivAeon yesterday, and have already submitted an OblivAeon game for a coming gaming convention.</p><p>There are a couple &quot;removed from game&quot; cases that raise interesting questions.</p><p>If a player is incapacitated as Stuntman after using &quot;In Media Res&quot;, if that player chooses Stuntman&#39;s variant as their next hero, is that card added back to the game?</p><p>Given Ra&#39;s variants, I&#39;m considering a house rule that you can play the other two versions of Ra in any order, but Setting Sun must be last. Let&#39;s say I don&#39;t apply that house rule. Would cards removed from the game by Setting Sun&#39;s base power be added back when the player chose another version of Ra?</p>",
