      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-12T03:52:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the game I ran on Sunday, if I'm remembering correctly, OblivAeon went to his second form after the counter hit 0. His shield was still on Phase 2. Does he automatically lose the shield in his second form, or is how it played out with the players taking down his shield and then pounding on him the proper procedure?</p>",
