      "created_at": "2018-09-13T15:43:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So what happens if the Aeon Master detonates an Aeon Warrior while Oblivaeon is in the other zone? Does it do nothing, since the effect itself lacks the ability to reach across zones? Does it hit the highest in the Aeon Master’s zone, because that’s where the effect is occurring? Or does it hit the highest in Oblivaeon’s zone for some reason?</p>",
