      "created_at": "2018-09-14T14:42:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Aeon Men have \"if destroyed by OblivAeon\" effects, Aeon Man allows OblivAeon to destroy the Aeon Man with the lowest HP even if OblivAeon is in the other battle zone, which would then trigget the \"destroyed by OblivAeon\" effect. I'm seeing nothing on Aeon Master's card, nor the Scion deck, about Aeon Master destroying Aeon Men.</p>\n<p>I had thought Fanatic's&nbsp;<em>Divine Focus</em> might be affected by zones, but realized a turn is a turn, no matter where it happens.</p>",
