      "created_at": "2018-09-15T13:49:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm going to say Oblivaeon deals that damage to hero target with the highest HP in the zone Oblivaeon is in. While he can destroy Aeon Men across zones, there's nothing on the Aeon Warrior's card that says Oblivaeon can reach across zones for the damage.</p>",
